+  U6c, Q-U6C-5's names); U7's dist build (`rs.yaml`) and the page's URL contract and records (`ops/browser/config.mjs`).
+  Every npt-log is named `*.jsonl`, the one extension npt-judge reads (NC-SB-1): rooms, npt-super, LG's npt-load
